{"code":"PK25","wikidata":"Q123537785","wikipedia":{"en":"Outer Ring Road - Ram Inthra MRT station","th":"สถานีวงแหวนรามอินทรา"},"summary":{"en":"Outer Ring Road - Ram Inthra station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Ram Inthra Road, near its intersection with Kanchanaphisek Road in Khan Na Yao district, Bangkok. The station has four exits and is located in close proximity to Fashion Island & The Promenade shopping malls.","th":"สถานีวงแหวนรามอินทรา เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนรามอินทราในพื้นที่เขตคันนายาว กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2.jpg/960px-%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2.jpg","author":"Maprangsriwutchai","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/MRT_Pink_Line_Outer_Ring_Road_-_Ram_Inthra_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Outer_Ring_Road_-_Ram_Inthra_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Outer_Ring_Road_-_Ram_Inthra_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/MRT_Pink_Line_Outer_Ring_Road_-_Ram_Inthra_Stat